{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06593","headline":"赴冯翊作 · 储光羲","name":"赴冯翊作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"本自江海人，且无寥廓志。\n大明耀天宇，霭霭风雨被。\n迢递别荆吴，飘颻涉沂泗。\n广川俟舟檝，峻坂伤骐骥。\n蹭蹬失归道，崎岖从下位。\n西出太华阴，北走少梁地。\n葱茏墟落色，泱漭关河气。\n耻从侠烈游，甘爲刀笔吏。\n宝劒茱萸匣，岂忘知音贵。\n大道且泛然，沈浮未云异。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06593.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06593","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}